Definition of Done

All  acceptance criteria pass QA on the therapist web portal 

"Start session" is visibly disabled with correct tooltip for children with "No plan" and "Plan ended" status across all three entry points.

On mobile (iOS): universal link opens the app directly if installed, App Store if not.

On mobile (Android): universal link opens the app directly if installed, Play Store if not.

On desktop (macOS/Windows): modal shows a QR code with caption "This feature is available on the mobile app " QR code resolves to the correct store by phone OS.

The session initiator field ("Therapist" / "Parent") is written to the session record on session start and confirmed queryable by backend engineer.

Access control: a therapist account cannot trigger "Start session" for an unassigned child — confirmed by QA with a cross-caseload test account.

"Cancel" returns the therapist to the correct prior view with no state change — confirmed for all three entry points.



